package ai.cleanway.app

/**
 * The generic layer's corpus: scams paraphrased away from the words each
 * scheme's own rule waits for, and the legitimate traffic that carries the
 * same ingredients (a link, money, a code, a deadline) innocently.
 *
 * Written for the generic layer (MessageAnalyzer.generic) before it existed,
 * from the 2025–26 scheme descriptions (Bank of Russia, МВД, F6, Kaspersky);
 * no text copied from sources, phone, card and case numbers fictional,
 * domains invented. Paraphrased on purpose: "внесите остаток" for "оплатите
 * доставку", "комбинация из входящего сообщения" for "код из SMS", "надзорный
 * орган" for "прокуратура", "ни слова родным" for "никому не говорите". The
 * blind sets were neither read nor scored while writing it.
 *
 * The scams are split by the level the ingredients call for, not by what the
 * rules happened to reach: a foreign link with two of money, a code, a promise
 * and a threat is DANGEROUS; one of them is a caution. A code asked by someone
 * claiming to be an organisation, under secrecy or with a call to come, is
 * DANGEROUS without any link.
 *
 * The legitimate half is what must stay quiet: bank, operator, Госуслуги and
 * marketplace notices with their own links; login codes from services we have
 * no domain list for, with "никому не сообщайте"; shop promotions on the shop's
 * own site; family and work messages that ask for money next to a link; scam
 * warnings that name every ingredient.
 */
